WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.067 --> 00:00:03.400
-The Justice Department
subpoenaed

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.000
Donald Trump's former
chief of staff, Mark Meadows,

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.667
and Meadows is reportedly
complying with that subpoena,

00:00:07.667 --> 00:00:10.000
making him the highest-ranking
Trump official so far

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.167
to respond to a federal subpoena

00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:14.167
in the criminal investigation
of the attempted coup

00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:15.334
on January 6th.

00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:17.834
There are also bombshell
new text messages

00:00:17.834 --> 00:00:19.501
in a very bizarre scandal

00:00:19.501 --> 00:00:22.400
involving former NFL quarterback
and Trump supporter Brett Favre

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.067
that reveal just how corrupt

00:00:24.067 --> 00:00:25.567
the conservative movement
has become.

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:28.067
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:30.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:30.067 --> 00:00:32.067
♪♪

00:00:32.067 --> 00:00:34.567
You know, it took
like two full years,

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:36.400
but it really seems like
the Justice Department

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.067
is finally kicking it into gear

00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:39.901
when it comes to these
Trump investigations.

00:00:39.901 --> 00:00:42.567
They're seizing phones,
sending out dozens of subpoenas,

00:00:42.567 --> 00:00:43.734
and executing search warrants.

00:00:43.734 --> 00:00:44.901
I don't know what changed.

00:00:44.901 --> 00:00:46.901
Merrick Garland used to seem
like one of those

00:00:46.901 --> 00:00:48.901
movie detectives
on cruise control

00:00:48.901 --> 00:00:51.734
because he was only a month away
from collecting a pension,

00:00:51.734 --> 00:00:55.801
and now he's like a renegade cop
on a Harley in a leather jacket

00:00:55.801 --> 00:00:58.300
who kicks in doors
and holds perps out windows

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.701
while hissing, "You can either
tell me what happened

00:01:00.701 --> 00:01:03.033
or your brains can tell
the pavement."

00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:04.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.534 --> 00:01:06.868
The point is,
the DOJ's Trump investigation

00:01:06.868 --> 00:01:08.367
seems to be rapidly
intensifying.

00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:10.300
For example, yesterday,
we told you a...

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:13.634
well, a truly heartwarming story
about a delightful young man

00:01:13.634 --> 00:01:17.801
named Mike Lindell, who had his
phone seized by the FBI

00:01:17.801 --> 00:01:19.467
while he was at
a Hardee's drive-through.

00:01:19.467 --> 00:01:22.968
As he explained in a video,
the FBI agents at the scene

00:01:22.968 --> 00:01:25.801
told him not to talk about it,
but he did anyway.

00:01:25.801 --> 00:01:29.634
-The FBI came after me
and took my phone.

00:01:29.634 --> 00:01:31.634
They surrounded me
at a Hardee's

00:01:31.634 --> 00:01:35.801
and took my phone that I run all
my business, everything with.

00:01:35.801 --> 00:01:37.200
Um, they could've just...

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:41.367
What they've done
is weaponized the FBI.

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:43.834
It's disgusting.
I don't have a computer.

00:01:43.834 --> 00:01:45.400
Everything I do off that phone.

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:49.400
Everything was on there,
and, um...

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.567
And they told me
not to tell anybody.

00:01:51.567 --> 00:01:53.434
Here's an order not to.
"Don't tell anybody."

00:01:53.434 --> 00:01:55.267
Okay. I won't.
[ Chuckles ]

00:01:55.267 --> 00:01:58.467
Well, I am.
So, there you go.

00:01:58.467 --> 00:02:01.033
-Well, that is just the kind
of recklessness

00:02:01.033 --> 00:02:03.000
I would expect from
a 61-year-old man

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.667
who eats at Hardee's.

00:02:04.667 --> 00:02:05.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:08.067
Also, I doubt that paper
says the words,

00:02:08.067 --> 00:02:09.400
"Don't tell anybody."

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.334
It's an order from the FBI,

00:02:11.334 --> 00:02:13.133
not a note
passed in fifth grade.

00:02:20.968 --> 00:02:24.234
I bet that piece of paper isn't
even an order from the FBI.

00:02:24.234 --> 00:02:26.167
In fact, if you zoom in,
you can see

00:02:26.167 --> 00:02:28.367
it's actually just a letter
from Hardee's that reads...

00:02:42.067 --> 00:02:44.133
But also, when we first played
this clip yesterday,

00:02:44.133 --> 00:02:46.467
there was a very
revealing detail

00:02:46.467 --> 00:02:48.601
I glossed over
and want to revisit.

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:50.267
-Everything I do off that phone.

00:02:50.267 --> 00:02:51.300
Everything was on there.

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:53.300
-It was?
Well, then, I guess...

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:55.000
jackpot, FBI!

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.334 --> 00:02:59.567
Usually you'd need to raid
multiple offices and homes

00:02:59.567 --> 00:03:00.934
and sift through every box,

00:03:00.934 --> 00:03:03.100
closet, and drawer
you can find for hours.

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:04.434
But not with Mike Lindell.

00:03:04.434 --> 00:03:07.167
[As Lindell] Yeah, I keep it all
on my Motorola flip --

00:03:07.167 --> 00:03:08.968
texts, call logs,

00:03:08.968 --> 00:03:11.400
lists of crimes
both completed and planned,

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:12.567
in all my pictures.

00:03:12.567 --> 00:03:15.701
I don't trust the cloud,
or any clouds,

00:03:15.701 --> 00:03:18.033
'cause they look like
big fluffy pillows,

00:03:18.033 --> 00:03:20.300
but in reality,
they're filled with...

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:22.300
da air!

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:23.667
[Normal voice]
Now, you might...

00:03:23.667 --> 00:03:26.534
you might be wondering
which of the many

00:03:26.534 --> 00:03:28.334
Trump investigations
the Lindell raid

00:03:28.334 --> 00:03:29.868
was specifically related to.

00:03:29.868 --> 00:03:32.400
Well, it's a very bizarre
and complicated story.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:35.133
But basically, federal agents
apparently wanted to know more

00:03:35.133 --> 00:03:38.434
about Lindell's potential
connections to a plot concocted

00:03:38.434 --> 00:03:40.767
by a pro-Trump clerk
in Mesa County, Colorado,

00:03:40.767 --> 00:03:42.200
named Tina Peters,

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:45.033
who was indicted earlier this
year for election tampering,

00:03:45.033 --> 00:03:47.133
among other things.
Basically, Peters wanted

00:03:47.133 --> 00:03:49.701
to prove that the 2020 election
was tampered with,

00:03:49.701 --> 00:03:52.667
and in the process,
she herself allegedly tampered

00:03:52.667 --> 00:03:55.334
with election equipment
by breaching voting machines.

00:04:15.133 --> 00:04:18.501
Imagine being wily enough
to impersonate an IT consultant

00:04:18.501 --> 00:04:22.667
and then dumb enough to be
in cahoots with Mike Lindell.

00:04:22.667 --> 00:04:24.200
"Mike, it's Tina.
The feds are on to me.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:25.567
But don't worry --
I've encrypted each

00:04:25.567 --> 00:04:27.033
and every one
of our communications

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:28.467
and put them behind
multiple firewalls."

00:04:28.467 --> 00:04:29.834
[as Lindell]
Good to hear, Tina!

00:04:29.834 --> 00:04:32.767
I got everything you ever said
to me on the one phone,

00:04:32.767 --> 00:04:35.400
and also, I put in my five

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:37.400
under "Crime Tina."

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:39.868
[ Laughter ]

00:04:39.868 --> 00:04:41.334
[Normal voice]
So, at this point,

00:04:41.334 --> 00:04:43.834
one can only assume
the Justice Department already

00:04:43.834 --> 00:04:46.400
has at its disposal
a wealth of information

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:48.434
related to the coup attempt
on January 6th,

00:04:48.434 --> 00:04:50.868
the various figures
involved in it,

00:04:50.868 --> 00:04:52.434
and the machinations
that led up to it,

00:04:52.434 --> 00:04:54.100
especially after
the newest revelations

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:56.534
we learned last night that
Trump's former chief of staff,

00:04:56.534 --> 00:04:58.968
Mark Meadows,
has also been subpoenaed

00:04:58.968 --> 00:05:01.033
and has responded
to that subpoena.

00:05:01.033 --> 00:05:02.367
-We are learning that former

00:05:02.367 --> 00:05:04.667
Trump White House
Chief of Staff Mark Meadows

00:05:04.667 --> 00:05:07.501
has complied with a subpoena
from the Justice Department's

00:05:07.501 --> 00:05:10.834
investigation into events
surrounding January 6th.

00:05:10.834 --> 00:05:13.834
So, this makes him the
highest-ranking Trump official,

00:05:13.834 --> 00:05:17.200
Trump administration official
that's known to have responded

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:19.801
to a subpoena
in this federal investigation.

00:05:19.801 --> 00:05:22.033
-So far, Mark Meadows,
the president--

00:05:22.033 --> 00:05:24.734
former President Trump's
chief of staff,

00:05:24.734 --> 00:05:26.634
has complied
with the DOJ subpoena

00:05:26.634 --> 00:05:28.934
by turning over documents,
the same documents

00:05:28.934 --> 00:05:31.234
that he turned over
to the January 6 committee.

00:05:31.234 --> 00:05:33.067
-Wow, even Trump's former
chief of staff

00:05:33.067 --> 00:05:34.434
is turning over documents now.

00:05:34.434 --> 00:05:35.767
And this is a guy, by the way,

00:05:35.767 --> 00:05:38.067
who is, by all accounts,
always on his phones.

00:05:38.067 --> 00:05:40.567
In July, he was spotted
walking around D.C.

00:05:40.567 --> 00:05:42.200
while reporters shouted
questions at him

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:44.100
about the January 6 hearing,
and for the most part,

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:45.834
refused to look up
from his phone.

00:05:45.834 --> 00:05:47.501
He looks like me
when my kids are demanding

00:05:47.501 --> 00:05:48.834
to go to the beach.
"Yeah, sure, sure.

00:05:48.834 --> 00:05:51.300
We can go to the beach.
I just need to set

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:53.868
my fantasy lineup
and check out the new memes.

00:05:53.868 --> 00:05:55.334
Then I want to see
some Instagram ads

00:05:55.334 --> 00:05:58.834
from sneaker companies that
only exist on Instagram ads."

00:05:58.834 --> 00:06:00.734
[ Laughter ]

00:06:00.734 --> 00:06:02.234
Of course, the only thing
stranger than Meadows'

00:06:02.234 --> 00:06:03.701
refusal to look up
from his phone

00:06:03.701 --> 00:06:07.000
was the fact that he was wearing
a fleece outdoors in July.

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.367
Do you know
how hot it was in July?

00:06:09.367 --> 00:06:10.734
It was so hot that
during one show

00:06:10.734 --> 00:06:14.067
I wore a sweater
and nothing else.

00:06:14.067 --> 00:06:15.767
You just couldn't see
because of the desk.

00:06:15.767 --> 00:06:17.501
Although it was a little jarring

00:06:17.501 --> 00:06:18.801
when I got up
to greet the guests.

00:06:18.801 --> 00:06:21.968
Now, you might remember Meadows

00:06:21.968 --> 00:06:24.300
as the guy who was in many ways
at the center

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:26.167
of the attempted coup,
who, among other things,

00:06:26.167 --> 00:06:27.634
arranged various
coup-related meetings

00:06:27.634 --> 00:06:29.100
and sent insane
conspiracy theories

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:30.868
about vote tampering
with the Justice Department.

00:06:30.868 --> 00:06:33.968
Meadows was also, according to
the people around him,

00:06:33.968 --> 00:06:35.367
extremely checked out

00:06:35.367 --> 00:06:36.801
in the days
leading up to the insurrection.

00:06:36.801 --> 00:06:38.901
Former Trump aide
Cassidy Hutchinson

00:06:38.901 --> 00:06:40.334
recalled after Rudy Giuliani

00:06:40.334 --> 00:06:42.434
told her about the plan
to march to the Capitol,

00:06:42.434 --> 00:06:44.300
she asked Meadows
about that plan,

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:47.467
and Meadows once again did not
even look up from his phone.

00:06:47.467 --> 00:06:50.267
-After Mr. Giuliani had left
the campus that evening,

00:06:50.267 --> 00:06:53.901
I went back up to our office
and I found Mr. Meadows

00:06:53.901 --> 00:06:55.567
in his office on the couch.

00:06:55.567 --> 00:06:57.534
He was scrolling
through his phone.

00:06:57.534 --> 00:07:00.100
I remember leaning against
the doorway and saying,

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:03.300
"Just had an interesting
conversation with Rudy, Mark.

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:05.968
It sounds like we're going to go
to the Capitol."

00:07:05.968 --> 00:07:07.567
He didn't look up from his phone

00:07:07.567 --> 00:07:10.100
and said something
to the effect of,

00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:14.033
"There's a lot going on, Cass,
but I don't know.

00:07:14.033 --> 00:07:17.033
Things might get real,
real bad on January 6th."

00:07:17.033 --> 00:07:19.968
-Man, this dude was checked out
like a substitute teacher

00:07:19.968 --> 00:07:23.000
showing his class "Amadeus"
on laserdisc

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.834
the day before summer break.

00:07:24.834 --> 00:07:27.734
"Hey, Mr. Meadows.
We gonna learn anything today?"

00:07:27.734 --> 00:07:29.434
"You're gonna learn what happens
to the human spirit

00:07:29.434 --> 00:07:30.901
when you're forced
to toil in the shadow

00:07:30.901 --> 00:07:32.901
of a childish show-off."

00:07:32.901 --> 00:07:34.234
[ Laughter ]

00:07:34.234 --> 00:07:36.167
"Also, you're all
getting an F!

00:07:36.167 --> 00:07:38.667
And F. Murray Abraham, that is."

00:07:38.667 --> 00:07:40.334
[ Laughter and
scattered applause ]

00:07:43.667 --> 00:07:45.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:47.667 --> 00:07:50.167
Oh, I'll wait till it gets
what it deserves.

00:07:50.167 --> 00:07:51.667
[ Laughter ]

00:07:51.667 --> 00:07:56.000
Although in fairness, that is
probably the one and only moment

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.501
from all the January 6 hearings
that I related to.

00:07:58.501 --> 00:08:00.667
If I had sold my soul
to Donald Trump

00:08:00.667 --> 00:08:02.567
and was facing a lifetime
of criminal exposure

00:08:02.567 --> 00:08:03.901
and historical disgrace,

00:08:03.901 --> 00:08:05.534
I, too, would
check the [bleep] out.

00:08:05.534 --> 00:08:07.901
I'd have one of those giant
Costco containers

00:08:07.901 --> 00:08:10.601
of cheese balls, except
it'd be filled with Xanax.

00:08:10.601 --> 00:08:14.000
So virtually everyone in Trump's
orbit, from his chief of staff

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:16.100
to his weird pillow friend,
is under investigation.

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:18.267
Now, if it feels to you

00:08:18.267 --> 00:08:20.234
like every story you hear
about the Republican Party

00:08:20.234 --> 00:08:23.167
and conservative movement is
about the deep rot of corruption

00:08:23.167 --> 00:08:25.200
at the heart
of GOP institutions,

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:26.367
that's because it's true.

00:08:26.367 --> 00:08:27.701
And to drive the point home,

00:08:27.701 --> 00:08:29.300
there's a truly insane story

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:30.667
that we're learning
more about this week

00:08:30.667 --> 00:08:32.367
that captures
the fundamental truth

00:08:32.367 --> 00:08:34.367
about just how corrupt
and morally bankrupt

00:08:34.367 --> 00:08:36.067
conservative governance
has become.

00:08:36.067 --> 00:08:37.634
The story involves
retired quarterback

00:08:37.634 --> 00:08:40.033
and dungarees pitchman
Brett Favre,

00:08:40.033 --> 00:08:42.501
millions of dollars that were
supposed to help poor people

00:08:42.501 --> 00:08:43.834
in the country's poorest state,

00:08:43.834 --> 00:08:46.934
and a shadowy deal to build
a volleyball facility.

00:08:46.934 --> 00:08:50.200
-New court documents filed
this week include text messages

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:52.834
that appear to show
Mississippi's former governor

00:08:52.834 --> 00:08:55.167
helping NFL Hall of Famer
Brett Favre

00:08:55.167 --> 00:08:58.200
secure millions to build
a volleyball facility --

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:01.434
money that came from funds
meant for needy families

00:09:01.434 --> 00:09:03.634
in one of the nation's
poorest states.

00:09:03.634 --> 00:09:05.901
-The texts appear to show
the former governor,

00:09:05.901 --> 00:09:08.033
Phil Bryant, helping Favre

00:09:08.033 --> 00:09:11.234
secure millions to build
a volleyball facility

00:09:11.234 --> 00:09:13.934
at his alma mater, University
of Southern Mississippi.

00:09:13.934 --> 00:09:16.367
And mind you, his daughter
also played volleyball there.

00:09:16.367 --> 00:09:18.834
Now, the money was allegedly
earmarked, though,

00:09:18.834 --> 00:09:21.400
for family welfare programs
at the state.

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:24.300
-Again, this is federal money
for welfare

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:25.968
for poor Mississippians,

00:09:25.968 --> 00:09:28.801
going to a volleyball facility

00:09:28.801 --> 00:09:31.300
that Brett Favre's daughter
is going to play in.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:34.801
The woman who ran the nonprofit,
Nancy New, reportedly coughed up

00:09:34.801 --> 00:09:38.968
$4 million
in misused welfare money.

00:09:38.968 --> 00:09:43.000
And when that was not enough,
she then allegedly paid Favre --

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:46.067
Brett Favre,
millionaire Brett Favre --

00:09:46.067 --> 00:09:50.300
an additional $1.1 million
personally to him,

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:51.634
supposedly for radio ads

00:09:51.634 --> 00:09:55.033
paid for out of a fund
for welfare recipients.

00:09:55.033 --> 00:09:57.033
-Now, remember, this is
the same state, Mississippi,

00:09:57.033 --> 00:09:59.367
that's also been facing
a disastrous water crisis

00:09:59.367 --> 00:10:01.367
affecting the majority-Black
city of Jackson.

00:10:01.367 --> 00:10:04.133
And yet the state's Republicans
are so cartoonishly corrupt

00:10:04.133 --> 00:10:06.267
they stole money
set aside for poor people

00:10:06.267 --> 00:10:09.000
and gave it to a multi-
millionaire NFL quarterback.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.334
I think as punishment,

00:10:10.334 --> 00:10:12.534
from this point forward,
Favre should not be remembered

00:10:12.534 --> 00:10:14.634
for his 16 seasons
with the Green Bay Packers,

00:10:14.634 --> 00:10:16.767
but for his one season
with the New York Jets.

00:10:16.767 --> 00:10:19.133
I'm sorry, Brett.

00:10:19.133 --> 00:10:21.467
Actions have consequences.

00:10:21.467 --> 00:10:24.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:24.467 --> 00:10:26.300
Although it should be noted,

00:10:26.300 --> 00:10:28.801
they did win
the Super Bowl that year.

00:10:28.801 --> 00:10:30.133
I mean, they went 9-7,

00:10:30.133 --> 00:10:32.467
but that's like a Super Bowl
for the Jets.

00:10:32.467 --> 00:10:35.267
[ Laughter ]

00:10:35.267 --> 00:10:37.000
You know, sometimes we have
international viewers

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:38.367
who leave comments for me

00:10:38.367 --> 00:10:40.000
and they say, "We really
don't like these Jets jokes,

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:41.334
because obviously
we don't get them."

00:10:41.334 --> 00:10:42.801
So just let me explain.
It's gonna take a minute,

00:10:42.801 --> 00:10:45.801
and I apologize
for taking time out of the day.

00:10:45.801 --> 00:10:47.234
Football is a sport.

00:10:47.234 --> 00:10:48.734
The Jets are [bleep]
at football.

00:10:48.734 --> 00:10:49.968
[ Laughter ]

00:10:49.968 --> 00:10:51.767
But the craziest part
of this scandal is that

00:10:51.767 --> 00:10:54.200
Favre turns out to be
just as dumb

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:56.434
as all the other corrupt weirdos
in Trump's orbit.

00:10:56.434 --> 00:10:58.567
Because as the deal
was happening,

00:10:58.567 --> 00:11:01.801
he apparently wrote
a text message explaining

00:11:01.801 --> 00:11:05.501
that he was concerned people
would find out it was happening.

00:11:05.501 --> 00:11:08.400
-Texts show Favre was worried
about how it might look.

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:10.234
He wrote,
"If you were to pay me,

00:11:10.234 --> 00:11:12.100
is there any way
the media can find out

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:14.067
where it came from
and how much?"

00:11:14.067 --> 00:11:15.868
-Yeah.

00:11:15.868 --> 00:11:18.033
Yeah, dude, there's a way.

00:11:18.033 --> 00:11:19.033
[ Laughter ]

00:11:19.033 --> 00:11:21.033
I love that he's asking

00:11:21.033 --> 00:11:22.534
if it could ever go public

00:11:22.534 --> 00:11:25.534
via a text
that eventually went public.

00:11:25.534 --> 00:11:26.701
Was the next text...

00:11:34.367 --> 00:11:36.000
This is the rot
and the moral bankruptcy

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.734
of conservative governments
at its core.

00:11:37.734 --> 00:11:39.300
This is the same
conservative movement

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:41.400
that's hell-bent
on dismantling democracy

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:43.300
and installing themselves
as unelected rulers.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.567
And apparently,
while they were all engaged

00:11:45.567 --> 00:11:47.434
in various scandals
and criminal schemes,

00:11:47.434 --> 00:11:49.801
they were texting each other
about those scandals

00:11:49.801 --> 00:11:52.167
and criminal schemes
and telling each other...

00:11:52.167 --> 00:11:53.667
-Don't tell anybody.

00:11:53.667 --> 00:11:56.334
-This has been "A Closer Look."

